---
config:
  theme: redux
  look: classic
  layout: elk
---
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Open AI Template Maker]
    B --> C[Describe desired template]
    C --> D[Provide fields, styling, and branding]
    D --> E[AI generates template and manifest]
    E --> F[Review generated template]
    F --> G{Changes required?}

    G -- Yes --> H[Describe requested changes]
    H --> E

    G -- No --> I[Preview sample document]
    I --> J[Run validation]
    J --> K{Validation successful?}

    K -- No --> L[Display validation errors]
    L --> H

    K -- Yes --> M[Save or submit template]
    M --> N([End])